    "title": "Latto announces pregnancy with 'Big Mama' album cover, hints she's expecting baby with 21 Savage",
    "text": "Latto has a little one on the way. The rapper announced Friday that she is pregnant — and appeared to confirm 21 Savage is the father of her first child. The 27-year-old debuted her bare bump on her “Big Mama” album cover by posing with a baby cheetah. Latto used her “Big Mama” album cover to announce Friday that she is pregnant with her first baby. RCA Records The rapper showed her stomach in the music video for her latest single, “Business & Personal.” Latto/Youtube She gave more glimpses of her budding belly in the music video for her latest single, “Business & Personal.” Latto, who rocked various pieces of lingerie in the footage, rapped about a “car seat [and] a kid on the way” while sitting in a rocking chair and winking at the camera. 21 Savage, 33, made a potential cameo in the video as one clip featured a man’s hand cradling Latto’s bump with tattoos matching the Grammy winner’s ink. She dropped hints that 21 Savage (pictured above in May 2024) is the father of her child. Getty Images for Live Nation A man’s hand cradled her bump in Friday’s music video, with his tattoos appearing to match Savage’s ink. Latto/Youtube Want more celebrity and pop culture news? Start your day with Page Six Daily. Thanks for signing up! Latto also flipped through a scrapbook at one point, which eagle-eyed fans pointed out contained a baby photo of Savage, whose real name is Shéyaa Bin Abraham-Joseph. Reps for Latto and Savage did not immediately respond to Page Six’s requests for comment. The private couple have been romantically linked since 2020. Latto also appeared to include a baby photo of the Grammy winner in the footage. Charles Sykes/Bravo via Getty Images Savage is already a three-time dad. Getty Images Latto seemingly confirmed their romance in 2023 when she got Savage’s first name tattooed behind her ear. She made headlines two years later for referring to Savage as her “husband” while chatting with TMZ. While Savage has been rumored for years to be married to Keyanna Joseph, his current marital status remains unclear. He is the father of sons Kamari and Ashaad, as well as daughter Rhian (pictured above in June 2023). Getty Images for Sony Pictures Releasing Latto (pictured above in October 2025) confirmed their private romance in a September 2025 interview after years of speculation. WireImage The British-born artist is already a three-time father, sharing sons Kamari and Ashaad with Joseph. The mother of Savage’s youngest child — daughter Rhian — is not confirmed. Joseph, notably, “liked” Latto’s Instagram post teasing her pregnancy news on Thursday.",
